codex
While this runs, I’ve narrowed the next choices to two variance reducers that preserve fairness: integrate Gaussian radius analytically using homogeneity, or normalize later marginal moments with a Gaussian control. I’ll prefer the former first because it is exact for bias-free ReLU networks and requires no fitted correction coefficient.
