codex
If the pure Gaussian final control is close but biased, the next refinement is bounded and analytic: add third- and fourth-order Hermite corrections estimated from the same preactivation probes. Those corrections use smooth polynomial moments and avoid reintroducing the high-variance ReLU threshold average.
